The behavior-classification semantics implement:
  E. L. Klijn, I. Tentina, D. Fahland, F. Mannhardt,
  "Decomposing Process Performance based on Actor Behavior", ICPM 2024,
  https://doi.org/10.1109/ICPM63005.2024.10680657
Reference implementation (no license file; queries rewritten with credit):
  https://github.com/multi-dimensional-process-mining/ekg_bpic17_decomposing_performance_by_actor_behavior
